  "description": "100 Rainbow Star Seamless Digital Papers | Colorful Star Patterns |\nCreate colorful and playful projects with this collection of 100 Rainbow Star Seamless Digital Papers. The set features repeating star patterns in a wide range of vibrant rainbow-inspired colors, from yellow, green and blue to purple, pink and red.\nEach design combines solid and outlined star shapes to create a fun, dynamic repeating pattern suitable for a variety of creative projects.\nDetails:\n◆ 100 unique seamless star patterns\n◆ JPG & PDF files\n◆ Size: 12 x 12 inches\n◆ 300 DPI\n◆ Square format\n◆ Rainbow color collection\n◆ Repeating seamless patterns\n◆ Suitable for digital and printable projects\nPerfect for scrapbooking, card making, invitations, backgrounds, stationery, planners, journals, crafts, packaging designs, and other creative projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>100 Rainbow Star Seamless Digital Papers | Colorful Star Patterns |</p>\n<p>Create colorful and playful projects with this collection of 100 Rainbow Star Seamless Digital Papers. The set features repeating star patterns in a wide range of vibrant rainbow-inspired colors, from yellow, green and blue to purple, pink and red.</p>\n<p>Each design combines solid and outlined star shapes to create a fun, dynamic repeating pattern suitable for a variety of creative projects.</p>\n<p>Details:</p>\n<p>◆ 100 unique seamless star patterns<br>\n◆ JPG &amp; PDF files<br>\n◆ Size: 12 x 12 inches<br>\n◆ 300 DPI<br>\n◆ Square format<br>\n◆ Rainbow color collection<br>\n◆ Repeating seamless patterns<br>\n◆ Suitable for digital and printable projects</p>\n<p>Perfect for scrapbooking, card making, invitations, backgrounds, stationery, planners, journals, crafts, packaging designs, and other creative projects.</p>",
